  "findings": {
    "251": "Four bays/rows and separate access/open well present. Repair overly brown brick and black cornice to source pale buff/gray, add continuous paired middle panels and white sashes. Ground red should be plain paint.",
    "253": "Four rows/bays and raised round portal present; missing raised central cornice and broad paired blind arch, wider masonry relief, lower wells. Tree masks front entrance: inspect inboard replacement, keep tree.",
    "255": "Tall stepped parapet/4x4 round top openings present; add observed pale insets in blank parapet and brick arch surround.",
    "257": "Wrong bracketed black cornice, dark red upper field, missing first-floor triangular heads, wrong single-line sign and small isolated black canopies. Repair to cream low parapet, buff/red pattern, three upper first-floor pediments, source two-line sign on continuous angled frame, solid lower/gold kickplate doors.",
    "church": "Individual mass sections, lancets and recess present. Solid wood scroll doors required (current glass leaf is wrong); gray stairs, fine pointed tracery and stronger pane subdivisions. Roof vertical pipes extend beyond low roof and need trimming. Avenue roof has intersections needing cleanup.",
